# Moxa ioLogik E2210.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik E2210 Ethernet Remote I/O — 8-channel DO + 12-channel DI
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP port 502
# | 
# | FC01 (0xxxx R/W): DO value/power-on/safe/pulse ctrl (0x0000-0x002F), DI counter ctrl (0x0030-0x0077)
# | FC02 (1xxxx R): DI bit value ch0-11 (0x0000-0x000B)
# | FC04 (3xxxx R): DI count value u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0x0000-0x0017); Citect DI word (0x3000-0x300B)
# | FC03 Citect (4xxxx): DO value (0x0100-0x0107), DO power-on (0x0108-0x010F), safe (0x0110-0x0117),
# | DO pulse/power-on-pulse/safe-pulse status (0x0118-0x012F), DI counter op/clear/overflow/trigger/
# | power-on/safe (0x0130-0x0177), Int Reg 00-23 initial (0x0178-0x018F), working (0x0B68-0x0B7F)
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E2210
@description=8-DO + 12-DI Modbus/TCP Ethernet remote I/O (port 502). FC03: DO_pulseOutputCount u32 hi+lo ch0-7 (0-15), DO_pulseLowWidth ch0-7 (16-23), DO_pulseHighWidth ch0-7 (24-31), DO_mode ch0-7 (32-39, 0=DO 1=Pulse), DI_countFilter ch0-11 (40-51), DI_mode ch0-11 (52-63, 0=DI 1=Count). Citect FC03: DO_value ch0-7 (0x0100-0x0107), DO_powerOnValue (0x0108-0x010F), DO_safeModeValue (0x0110-0x0117), DI_counterTrigger ch0-11 (0x0154-0x015F, 0=L2H 1=H2L). FC04: DI_countValue u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0x0000-0x0017). FC01: DO bit ctrl (0x0000-0x002F), DI counter ctrl (0x0030-0x0077).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-e2210.toml; Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
